  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "As we move through the memento implementation, FedoraVersioningIT is in the process of replacing FedoraVersionsIT.  This ticket is a short list of refactorings to tidy up the integration tests.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "1. Move any applicable tests in FedoraVersionsIT to FedoraVersioningIT",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Remove FedoraVersionsIT",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Move any versioning related tests from FedoraLdpIT to FedoraVersioningIT",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Move methods from AbstractVersioningIT into FedoraVersioningIT and remove AbstractVersioningIT.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. Make FedoraLdpIT inherit from AbstractResourceIT.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
