  "description": "<p>As we move through the memento implementation, FedoraVersioningIT is in the process of replacing FedoraVersionsIT.  This ticket is a short list of refactorings to tidy up the integration tests.</p>\n\n<p>1. Move any applicable tests in FedoraVersionsIT to FedoraVersioningIT<br/>\n2. Remove FedoraVersionsIT<br/>\n3. Move any versioning related tests from FedoraLdpIT to FedoraVersioningIT<br/>\n4. Move methods from AbstractVersioningIT into FedoraVersioningIT and remove AbstractVersioningIT.<br/>\n5. Make FedoraLdpIT inherit from AbstractResourceIT.</p>",
